/-!
# All-level geometric null-harmonic Dirac recurrence

The solid-harmonic packet is generated by powers of one complex null linear
form.  This file realizes the same construction directly on genuine smooth
SpinC sections.  Coordinate multiplication and Clifford differentiation are
packaged as real-linear maps, while the already descended global complex
structure supplies the complex coefficients.

The key recurrence is uniform in the degree.  It replaces every future
level-by-level Dirac expansion.
-/

namespace JanusFormal
namespace P0EFTJanusProgramPD9PrimitiveSpinCAllLevelNullHarmonicDirac4D

set_option autoImplicit false
noncomputable section

